## <summary>jaato agent-runner confinement.</summary>
## <desc>
##	<p>
##	Domains for jaato session runners (jaato_runner_t) and the
##	subprocesses a model drives (jaato_child_t), and the file types a
##	workspace is labelled with. See docs/design/selinux-backend.md.
##	</p>
##	<p>
##	No interfaces are exported yet: nothing outside this module needs to
##	interact with jaato's types. A daemon confined in its own domain
##	(design §13, open question 1) would be the first caller.
##	</p>
## </desc>
